  "fullDescription": "2027 Craft Business Planner – Canva Template\n\nStay organized, profitable, and ready to grow your handmade business in 2027 with this beautifully designed Craft Business Planner Canva template! Whether you’re selling at craft shows, running an online shop, or building your brand on Etsy and Shopify, this all-in-one planner keeps every part of your craft business on track.\n\nPerfect for craft business tracking, inventory management, sales tracking, craft show preparation, marketing planning, and budgeting. Fully customizable in Canva — change fonts, colors, and layout with ease — and start growing your craft business today.\n\nWhat’s Inside:\n\n▸ This Planner Belongs To\n▸ Bank Account Details\n▸ 2027 Calendar + Holidays\n▸ Monthly Calendars (Jan–Dec) with Self-care Notes\n▸ Branding Kit\n▸ Price List\n▸ Craft Inventory\n▸ Online Shopping Tracker\n▸ Shopping List\n▸ Customer Receipt\n▸ Income Tracker\n▸ Creative Goals\n▸ Monthly Sales Tracker\n▸ Yearly Report\n▸ Packaging Inventory\n▸ Order Tracker\n▸ Websites, Blogs & Inspiration Feeds\n▸ Budget Tracker\n▸ Where to Sell (Online + Physical + Selling Methods)\n▸ Your Wow Factor\n▸ Collection Ideas\n▸ Your Product Message & USP\n▸ Seasonal Promotions\n▸ Daily Schedule\n▸ Marketing Plan & Marketing Budget\n▸ Product Analysis & Competitor Analysis\n▸ Weekly To-Do List\n▸ Craft Calendar\n▸ Table Layout\n▸ Product Display Ideas & Sketches\n▸ Booth Layout\n▸ Sketch Your Craft Ideas\n▸ Project Planner\n▸ Launch Your Shop Checklist\n▸ Craft Show Checklist\n▸ Website Planner\n▸ Target Audience & Target Customer Market\n▸ Order Form\n▸ Customer Feedback\n▸ Meeting Notes\n▸ Donation Tracker\n▸ Tax Deduction\n▸ Investment Tracker\n▸ Customer Follow-up List\n▸ Contact List\n▸ Important Notes\n▸ Gift Project Planner\n▸ Craft Bucket List\n▸ Creative Supplies Log\n▸ Show Products Research\n▸ Craft To-Do List\n▸ Goals Tracker\n▸ Password Tracker\n▸ Craft Ideas & Sketches\n▸ Craft Vision Board\n▸ Notes Pages\n\n